# BKR INFRA website — environment variables
#
# Nothing in Task 1 (scaffold, brand tokens, typography) reads process.env.
# This file is reserved for later tasks: the Sanity data source, lead-capture
# email delivery, and the /api/revalidate secret. Populate it as those tasks
# introduce real variable names — do not guess them here ahead of time.

# Task 23 (SEO, metadata, structured data): this site's own canonical origin, with no
# trailing slash. Used for metadataBase, the sitemap's absolute URLs and JSON-LD. Falls back
# to http://localhost:3000 (the same address Next.js itself already assumes once metadataBase
# is unset) when this is not set, so local dev and CI need nothing here — set it to the real
# production domain once one is registered, not before.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.bkrinfra.com
